PE 889: Rational Blancmange / 有理牛奶冻

=== Blancmange function values ===
  B(0)    = 0.00000000
  B(0.25) = 0.50000000
  B(0.5)  = 0.50000000
  B(1/3)  = 0.66666667
  B(0.75) = 0.50000000
  B(1.0)  = 0.00000000

=== Rational values p/q ===
  q=2: 1/2=0.500000
  q=3: 1/3=0.666667 2/3=0.666667
  q=4: 1/4=0.500000 3/4=0.500000
  q=5: 1/5=0.533333 2/5=0.666667 3/5=0.666667 4/5=0.533333
  q=6: 1/6=0.500000 5/6=0.500000
  q=7: 1/7=0.448980 2/7=0.612245 3/7=0.653061 4/7=0.653061 5/7=0.612245 6/7=0.448980
  q=8: 1/8=0.375000 3/8=0.625000 5/8=0.625000 7/8=0.375000

=== Properties of B(x) ===
  B(x) = B(1-x)  (symmetry)
  B(x) is continuous but nowhere differentiable
  max B(x) = 2/3 at x = 1/3, 2/3

=== Partial sums ===
  B_40(1/3) partial to n=5: 0.6458333333
  B_40(1/3) partial to n=10: 0.6660156250
  B_40(1/3) partial to n=20: 0.6666660309
  B_40(1/3) partial to n=40: 0.6666666667

